 Install:
 
 ```bash
-adb install -r dist/webdav-debug.apk
+adb install -r dist/webdav-debug-modern.apk   # or webdav-debug-legacy.apk
 ```
 
+### Which variant do I install?
+
+- **modern** — Android 12 or newer.
+- **legacy** — Android 8.0 to 11 (or any device the modern APK refuses to install on). Uses the classic storage permission, asked at runtime. 64-bit (arm64) devices only; 32-bit-only phones are not supported.
+
+The server holds a CPU wake lock and a Wi-Fi lock while running, so it keeps serving with the screen off.
+
